Package: forestmap
Title: Visualising Multiple Sources of Meta-Analytic Heterogeneity
Version: 0.2.1
Authors@R: 
    c(person("Shaheed", "Azaad", , "shaheedazaad_work@icloud.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
      person("The Roboto Project Authors", role = "cph",
             comment = "Roboto Condensed font in inst/fonts (SIL Open Font License 1.1)"))
Description: Draws a forest plot of the studies in a meta-analysis, sorted
    by effect size, above a heatmap of study properties such as population,
    design or country. Supply one row per study (effect size and 95%
    confidence interval) and the factor columns describing each study; the
    plot shows at a glance whether studies with particular properties tend
    to find larger or smaller effects.
